 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t enough reliable review information here to name one company as definitively “best.” **Arch City Title** is a reasonable first call: it serves St. Charles County and offers title insurance and escrow closings. **US Title** is another local option, with an office at 6229 Mid Rivers Mall Dr.\n\nBefore choosing, ask each for a written estimate of closing fees, confirm they regularly handle your type of transaction, and check recent reviews for communication and on-time closings. You can also ask your lender whether it has any requirements; the buyer and seller may have a say in selecting the title company.",
